    <string name="privacy_summary">No data collected</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">PDF Flattener collects no data.\n\nThe app has no internet access: it cannot send anything anywhere. Documents are processed on your device only, and only the latest one is kept, in the app\'s private storage, until you open the next.\n\nThe app keeps only your settings, on your device. It has no account, no ads, no analytics and no tracking.\n\nIt reads a document only when you choose it or share it to the app, and writes only where you save it.\n\nContact: %1$s</string>
